I wake up in the morning.
I open the window.
It is very sunny outside.
It is very hot in Kochi now.
I take my phone.
I check the weather on my phone.
The app shows today's weather.
It is very hot in the morning.
It is very hot in the afternoon too.
But, it will rain in the evening.
I have to go to the office.
I open the wardrobe.
I take out a cotton outfit.
Cotton clothing is best for this heat.
I put it on.
I grab my bag.
I put an umbrella in the bag.
It will rain today.
Therefore, an umbrella is needed.
I get ready to go out.
